ithub.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113038#issuecomment-3567993637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113038","id":3567993637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Uq0Ml","user":{"login":"Oblepikha","id":77234360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjM0MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77234360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha","html_url":"https://github.com/Oblepikha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T14:08:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T14:15:30Z","body":"I think I found a reproducible case. Build the node structure like this:\n\n```\n# bad_parent.tscn\nBadParent (Node)\n  _Node1\n  _Node2\n```\n\n```\n# main.tscn\nNode\n  BadParent (bad_parent.tscn)\n    Node1\n    Node2\n```\n\n1. Select Node1\n2. Ctrl+Up (Node1 stays first)\n3. Ctrl+Down (Node1 moves to last)\n4. Save the scene\n5. Reload the scene (Node1 is first again)\n\nThere should probably be a check somewhere to detect if the parent node is an instanced scene (the starting index is not zero)\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/235a32ad11f40ecba26d6d9ceea8ab245c13adb0/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L834-L835\n\nIn the editor you should not be able to move a node before the children of an instanced scene, unless editable children is enabled","author_a